So many robots. Well, we can just

01:50:56.720 --> 01:51:04.320
let everybody who’s working on robots in the world 
— let me tell you what I told you. The computer

01:51:04.320 --> 01:51:11.200
industry has been completely changed. In the 
last six months, everything changed. Everything

01:51:11.200 --> 01:51:18.080
changed because agents were realized, and it 
converged with the latest frontier models, and

01:51:18.080 --> 01:51:25.440
it made possible for AI to now do useful work.
The computing pattern will repeat over and over

01:51:25.440 --> 01:51:32.480
and over again. This computing pattern — an agent 
that has a model, a harness that uses tools with

01:51:32.480 --> 01:51:38.640
skills, and runs in a runtime — that runtime 
depends on whether it’s in a cloud or on-prem,

01:51:38.640 --> 01:51:45.280
on a PC or a robot. But the computing pattern 
is exactly the same for all of them. You will

01:51:45.280 --> 01:51:48.880
use different harnesses because of your 
preference. You’ll use different models

01:51:48.880 --> 01:51:53.600
because of your preference. You will improve 
them for your proprietary use. You would

01:51:53.600 --> 01:51:59.040
create super agents that you can offer to 
other people to help them do their work.

01:51:59.040 --> 01:52:06.320
This agentic platform, this agentic pattern — 
NVIDIA has an Enterprise AI Toolkit. This is a

01:52:06.320 --> 01:52:13.120
wonderful way for all of you to engage with AI, 
and for us it’s a wonderful growth opportunity.

01:52:13.120 --> 01:52:21.440
Vera Rubin is in full production. Whereas Grace 
Blackwell was created to process AI — particularly

01:52:21.440 --> 01:52:28.720
inference — Vera Rubin was created to run agents. 
It is in full production. It is much, much more

01:52:28.720 --> 01:52:35.840
than a GPU. It is an entire, disaggregated, 
distributed agent processing system.

01:52:35.840 --> 01:52:41.680
NVIDIA has really become an infrastructure company 
— not just a GPU company, not just a systems

01:52:41.680 --> 01:52:48.160
company, but an infrastructure company to help you 
generate the maximum revenue, the maximum profit,

01:52:48.160 --> 01:52:54.640
and to get there as soon as possible.
The agentic world — this new way of

01:52:54.640 --> 01:53:01.360
computing — where you build CPUs for agents, 
not for people. CPUs for agents have their

01:53:01.360 --> 01:53:08.240
own special requirements, and NVIDIA Vera is 
revolutionary. I’m so happy about its ramp.

01:53:08.240 --> 01:53:12.800
The orders are already in. It’s going 
to be the fastest and most successful

01:53:12.800 --> 01:53:18.000
product launch in our company’s history.
NVIDIA and Microsoft have created a whole

01:53:18.000 --> 01:53:26.640
new line of PCs. This is a new beginning, and of 
course, the exact same agentic computing pattern

01:53:26.640 --> 01:53:34.400
that I just described is also going to run on 
all kinds of devices. I mentioned PCs, but in

01:53:34.400 --> 01:53:41.280
the future it’ll be robots and satellites and base 
stations and factories — in the cloud, on-prem,

01:53:41.280 --> 01:53:50.240
at the edge. This agentic computing pattern will 
be replicated in computers all over the world.

01:53:50.240 --> 01:53:56.880
How we think about the personal computer will very 
likely change. I want to thank all of you for your

01:53:56.880 --> 01:54:02.480
